WEBVTT

00:02.394 --> 00:04.694
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.834 --> 00:07.864
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.374 --> 00:11.104
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.104 --> 00:15.734
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.174 --> 00:23.144
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.884 --> 00:27.754
Dragon Drive

00:27.754 --> 00:33.254
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.394 --> 00:36.364
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.364 --> 00:39.594
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.104 --> 00:44.474
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.474 --> 00:46.444
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.444 --> 00:52.744
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.484 --> 00:56.854
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.854 --> 01:00.054
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.394 --> 01:05.394
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.394 --> 01:06.954
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.094 --> 01:09.494
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.494 --> 01:12.624
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.034 --> 01:18.104
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.104 --> 01:20.844
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.844 --> 01:28.514
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:47.734 --> 01:50.464
We will give you a taste of true fear.

01:52.674 --> 01:55.014
Miss Sue and Master Lin
have been manipulated by RI-ON...

01:55.014 --> 01:58.274
...and a dragon called Darks
possesses their bodies and controls them.

01:58.744 --> 02:00.844
I understand now. Sorry, Chibi.

02:13.164 --> 02:16.224
Th-This can't be happening!

02:24.644 --> 02:27.944
As You Are

02:29.314 --> 02:31.074
What an awful injury.

02:32.444 --> 02:35.744
You can't possibly participate
in the upcoming matches.

02:36.154 --> 02:38.314
I'm okay. This is nothing!

02:42.454 --> 02:43.444
I'm so sorry!

02:43.624 --> 02:45.254
Oh, boy.

02:45.424 --> 02:47.964
Looks like getting past the preliminaries...

02:47.964 --> 02:50.124
...was just a waste of time!

02:51.864 --> 02:52.994
I'll participate!

02:53.704 --> 02:54.494
Maiko!

02:55.004 --> 02:57.064
I will take part in Dragonic Heaven...

02:57.504 --> 02:59.444
...to help stop RI-ON and their evil ways!

02:59.604 --> 03:00.904
M-Maiko!

03:01.414 --> 03:02.814
I'm so glad you feel that way!

03:04.584 --> 03:06.314
Damn you, Reiji!

03:06.484 --> 03:09.084
You really have a way of coming through
when we need you, Maiko!

03:09.084 --> 03:10.624
W-W-Wait a minute!

03:10.624 --> 03:11.854
Let go!

03:11.854 --> 03:13.184
How shall I put it?

03:13.184 --> 03:16.154
You've got guts, unlike Daisuke.

03:16.154 --> 03:17.454
I-I guess so.

03:25.304 --> 03:26.664
Hey, girl!

03:26.804 --> 03:29.134
Can't your dragon run any faster?!

03:29.134 --> 03:30.904
Your dragon's so slow!

03:35.614 --> 03:38.914
This is the best he can do
when he's running on sand!

03:39.144 --> 03:42.344
Why can't Gholaoh fly?
He's got wings, right?

03:42.984 --> 03:46.474
If he could fly,
we would've been flying long ago!

03:46.724 --> 03:47.894
Reiji!

03:47.894 --> 03:51.414
Can't you make Chibi large
so he can carry Gholaoh and me?

03:53.734 --> 03:55.194
Come on! Please!

03:57.204 --> 03:58.264
I guess it can't be helped.

03:58.264 --> 03:59.804
For crying out loud!

03:59.804 --> 04:03.974
If we had gone at our regular pace,
we'd have arrived there ages ago.

04:03.974 --> 04:07.844
At this rate, Daisuke would've been
a greater help to us, even with his injuries!

04:07.844 --> 04:08.974
Right?!

04:09.674 --> 04:12.684
W-Well, for one thing, Kanper does fly.

04:12.684 --> 04:14.244
Right?!

04:14.884 --> 04:16.874
Wh-What are you saying?!

04:16.984 --> 04:21.424
We need three to participate
in Dragonic Heaven, so...

04:21.424 --> 04:23.594
...why don't I go back and bring him?

04:23.594 --> 04:24.714
All right, then!

04:25.864 --> 04:28.164
Y-You two go on ahead.

04:28.364 --> 04:30.694
M-Maiko! What about you?!

04:31.204 --> 04:33.504
If we run straight toward that mountain...

04:33.504 --> 04:35.564
...we'll reach the town called Yaudim, right?

04:36.334 --> 04:39.444
Gholaoh and I will cross this desert alone!

04:39.444 --> 04:42.174
It's dangerous to cross it alone!

04:42.174 --> 04:43.644
Leave me alone!

04:44.684 --> 04:48.084
I'll show you what Gholaoh
and I are made of!

04:48.214 --> 04:50.204
All right! That's a good girl!

04:50.354 --> 04:51.714
Now, let's see you do exactly as you said!

04:52.854 --> 04:53.924
R-Rockaku!

04:53.924 --> 04:54.894
Wait a sec...

04:54.894 --> 04:56.654
Let's go, Thundervolt!

04:56.894 --> 04:59.064
We'll be waiting for you at Yaudim!

04:59.064 --> 05:01.324
Good luck, girl!

05:04.004 --> 05:06.024
Y-You're kidding.

05:08.434 --> 05:10.064
This is the pits!

05:11.744 --> 05:14.144
Can't you run any faster, Gholaoh?!

05:14.544 --> 05:16.374
They'll catch up to us!

05:17.314 --> 05:18.284
Come on!

05:18.284 --> 05:21.944
Just because I woke you up from your nap
is no reason for you all to charge at me!

05:25.124 --> 05:28.244
If I knew this would happen,
I wouldn't have been so stubborn.

05:29.994 --> 05:33.084
How could they leave a helpless girl
all alone like this in the desert?

05:33.394 --> 05:34.764
You demons!

05:40.374 --> 05:42.464
We outran them and I didn't even notice it.

05:42.774 --> 05:43.944
I get it!

05:43.944 --> 05:47.674
They ran away, realizing
they're no match for me, Miss Yukino!

05:49.074 --> 05:51.674
Well, naturally. It's only to be expected.

06:01.554 --> 06:03.324
Hey.

06:03.324 --> 06:05.624
That's Maiko Yukino and Gholaoh!

06:06.324 --> 06:08.434
A great chance to get some data on her!

06:08.434 --> 06:11.224
Will you get serious, Kouhei?

06:12.034 --> 06:13.004
Are you leaving?

06:13.634 --> 06:15.264
I've had it with your stops along the way.

06:16.634 --> 06:19.574
We have a mission to accomplish.
Am I wrong?

06:21.374 --> 06:23.004
You gotta learn to take it easy.

06:30.524 --> 06:32.424
We shouldn't have left her behind!

06:32.424 --> 06:35.054
I wonder if Maiko's okay!

06:37.494 --> 06:39.794
I can't stand listening to this!

06:40.224 --> 06:42.534
Get ready to go, Thundervolt!

06:42.534 --> 06:43.934
No way!

06:44.264 --> 06:45.364
A little longer!

06:45.364 --> 06:46.804
Let's wait, just a little longer!

06:47.334 --> 06:48.134
She'll come!

06:48.134 --> 06:49.934
Maiko will come for sure.

06:49.934 --> 06:51.404
So let's wait just a little longer!

06:51.404 --> 06:55.344
Besides, she's now officially
part of our team!

06:55.344 --> 06:56.404
Remember?!

06:57.014 --> 06:57.544
Wha!

06:57.544 --> 07:00.604
I never acknowledged her as a teammate!

07:02.014 --> 07:06.284
When push comes to shove,
Maiko has more guts than I do!

07:06.984 --> 07:08.954
She'll catch up to us, for sure!

07:08.954 --> 07:12.014
So, please wait for her
just a little while longer!

07:13.164 --> 07:14.394
One hour.

07:14.734 --> 07:16.634
I'll wait just one more hour.

07:16.934 --> 07:18.294
Rockaku...

07:19.034 --> 07:20.464
Maiko!

07:21.674 --> 07:25.504
Hurry up, Maiko!

07:32.514 --> 07:33.674
Where are you going?

07:34.354 --> 07:37.444
Do you have a date
with someone here in Rikyu?

07:39.184 --> 07:40.954
Wouldn't that be nice?

07:45.094 --> 07:48.364
I must return.

07:48.364 --> 07:50.134
To... Rikyu.

07:50.134 --> 07:51.254
Rikyu?

07:51.664 --> 07:53.164
That's right.

07:53.164 --> 07:58.304
The power that controls the dragons
and grants all wishes.

07:58.304 --> 08:00.034
I must go and get it back.

08:00.514 --> 08:02.634
Grants all wishes?

08:03.574 --> 08:06.634
Does such a thing really exist, Grandfather?

08:06.944 --> 08:08.384
Yes.

08:08.384 --> 08:11.184
Anyone getting his or her hands
on the Dragonite...

08:11.624 --> 08:15.614
...is given the ability to have it all.

08:18.494 --> 08:19.854
Dragonite.

08:21.194 --> 08:23.824
The power to grant all wishes.

08:24.404 --> 08:26.694
The Dragonite will be mine.

08:27.374 --> 08:28.864
You seem to be having fun.

08:29.274 --> 08:31.174
Are we taking different routes from here?

08:31.344 --> 08:35.074
You may come with me
if you promise not to get in my way.

08:35.914 --> 08:37.104
In your way?

08:39.244 --> 08:42.344
I've never seen you look so pleased
as you do right now.

08:42.584 --> 08:43.554
Really?

08:44.054 --> 08:47.544
I'll bet you're also hoping
for something great to happen.

08:49.254 --> 08:50.354
You may be right.

08:57.734 --> 09:00.004
You scum are weak.

09:00.004 --> 09:00.904
What?

09:01.204 --> 09:03.364
I'm not interested in weaklings like you!

09:16.354 --> 09:17.754
So, there are still some left.

09:23.294 --> 09:26.694
Broadly speaking, you look like someone
one would consider strong.

09:26.694 --> 09:28.224
However, that's only broadly speaking.

09:29.594 --> 09:32.934
I don't know exactly
how broadly you're speaking...

09:33.604 --> 09:35.094
...but I wouldn't consider myself weak.

09:49.314 --> 09:50.554
Kyo!

09:50.554 --> 09:52.384
Please look after things here.

09:54.294 --> 09:58.524
I must go and search Rikyu
for the Dragonite.

09:59.064 --> 09:59.864
So...

09:59.864 --> 10:01.324
...goodbye!

10:03.734 --> 10:04.894
Oh, boy.

10:05.364 --> 10:07.524
What is it about spoiled girls?

10:11.174 --> 10:14.234
The Dragonite is mine.
Nobody else shall touch it!

10:14.914 --> 10:16.904
This is beginning to get fun.

10:22.714 --> 10:26.274
We're completely lost now,
aren't we, Gholaoh?

10:28.224 --> 10:31.714
I wonder if Reiji
and Rockaku will look for me.

10:44.504 --> 10:45.974
What'll we do?

10:47.414 --> 10:49.474
Reiji, you jerk!

10:49.474 --> 10:51.964
I shouldn't have said what I said!

10:54.084 --> 10:55.514
What a beautiful sound!

10:56.014 --> 10:58.314
Did you hear it, Gholaoh?

10:59.084 --> 10:59.954
Listen.

11:01.154 --> 11:02.314
From over there.

11:27.614 --> 11:29.384
Isn't there anybody here?

11:31.624 --> 11:32.744
Hello!

11:42.134 --> 11:43.664
That sound from earlier.

11:43.664 --> 11:45.634
That was you, wasn't it?

11:48.274 --> 11:50.174
There's nothing to be afraid of.

11:50.174 --> 11:51.234
Come here.

11:51.604 --> 11:53.234
I'm Maiko Yukino.

11:53.744 --> 11:55.104
What's your name?

12:00.854 --> 12:01.814
Rin-Rin?

12:02.314 --> 12:03.974
Is your name Rin-Rin?

12:12.924 --> 12:14.914
Your home is like a castle.

12:15.434 --> 12:18.864
I wonder if the people
who lived here were musicians.

12:28.314 --> 12:30.434
Each tile has a different sound to it!

12:34.784 --> 12:36.374
Wow!

12:39.824 --> 12:42.984
I wonder if this place
used to be like an opera house.

12:43.794 --> 12:46.024
But why here, in the middle of a desert?

12:49.094 --> 12:51.224
Come on! Don't scare me like...

12:52.664 --> 12:54.724
So, where are you?

12:57.304 --> 12:58.434
How come?

12:59.204 --> 13:01.074
She's way down there...

13:01.314 --> 13:04.334
...but her voice sounded so loud,
like she was right behind me.

13:16.654 --> 13:18.824
He's strong.

13:28.904 --> 13:31.774
Broadly speaking, you're strong.

13:34.114 --> 13:35.444
What do you say?

13:35.444 --> 13:36.844
Why not become my subordinates?

13:36.844 --> 13:38.644
I'll give you the honor of serving under me.

13:38.644 --> 13:40.634
I must continue looking for some people.

13:40.914 --> 13:42.174
So I think I'll pass!

13:42.514 --> 13:44.284
This fellow's rudeness amazes me.

13:45.054 --> 13:47.084
Out of sympathy, I was even considering...

13:47.084 --> 13:49.114
...to let you fight in the Dragonic Heaven.

13:49.424 --> 13:50.914
Dragonic Heaven?

13:51.224 --> 13:54.234
And does something good happen
to those who participate?!

13:54.234 --> 13:55.194
Of course.

13:55.534 --> 13:58.194
If we were to become champions
of the Dragonic Heaven...

13:58.804 --> 14:01.094
...the Dragonite would become mine.

14:01.374 --> 14:02.804
I understand!

14:04.274 --> 14:05.364
I will join you.

14:07.674 --> 14:09.044
Mother!

14:09.944 --> 14:12.314
My name is Sayaka Towa.

14:12.514 --> 14:13.604
V-Very well.

14:14.044 --> 14:15.414
You may serve me as well!

14:15.414 --> 14:16.944
Thank you very much!

14:17.484 --> 14:19.144
And... your name is?

14:19.324 --> 14:21.614
I am Mukai!

14:22.424 --> 14:25.584
Thirteenth generation lord
of the honorable Gizaya Clan.

14:26.024 --> 14:28.494
You are to address me as Lord Mukai!

14:28.764 --> 14:31.354
I understand, Lord Mukai!

14:32.264 --> 14:35.234
The Dragonite is now as good as mine.

14:36.334 --> 14:37.334
Mother.

14:37.334 --> 14:39.044
I finally have the members I need.

14:39.044 --> 14:41.104
Please wait just a little longer.

14:41.844 --> 14:43.144
We shall now be on our way.

14:43.674 --> 14:46.074
Follow me, my subordinates!

14:47.384 --> 14:48.814
I'm your master.

14:50.254 --> 14:52.084
Scratch that, I'm your leader!

14:52.724 --> 14:55.344
Naturally, as my subordinate,
you should be responsible for carrying me!

14:58.694 --> 15:01.064
Hurry up and go!

15:03.464 --> 15:05.364
Did you call me, Rin-Rin?

15:07.974 --> 15:09.694
This pretty looking building.

15:10.174 --> 15:11.764
Could it be the same building that we're in?

15:18.744 --> 15:20.714
You're incredible, Rin-Rin.

15:20.884 --> 15:22.544
So you used to sing here.

15:23.314 --> 15:24.284
I see.

15:24.754 --> 15:27.154
It's practically buried under the sand now...

15:27.154 --> 15:29.284
...but I can see that this
used to be a wonderful place.

15:29.824 --> 15:32.294
But what happened to everyone here?

15:34.634 --> 15:35.434
Why, this is...

15:35.434 --> 15:36.634
He's here!

15:36.634 --> 15:38.794
Yaudim's Guan-Coo has come!

15:39.204 --> 15:41.634
Please let others know
about Guan-Coo's evil deeds!

15:42.034 --> 15:44.734
This sort of thing mustn't continue forever!

15:45.274 --> 15:46.294
Please.

15:55.814 --> 15:57.654
We no longer have any use for this place!

15:57.654 --> 16:00.054
Mr. Guan-Coo! Please go ahead!

16:15.874 --> 16:19.474
I'm counting on you
to let others know of our regrets...

16:19.474 --> 16:21.504
...and of the ugliness of conflict.

16:22.644 --> 16:24.944
That's cruel. Too cruel!

16:25.284 --> 16:29.114
She wanted to convey her master's message
to someone, no matter how long it took.

16:32.084 --> 16:33.254
A-An earthquake?

16:33.254 --> 16:34.484
This sound.

16:35.154 --> 16:35.954
Could it be?!

16:40.564 --> 16:42.664
I-It's those guys!

16:42.664 --> 16:44.634
Why did they chase me all the way here?!

16:47.904 --> 16:49.234
W-We're surrounded!

16:52.544 --> 16:55.844
How am I supposed to defeat
so many dragons?

16:56.944 --> 16:59.034
If only Reiji were here at a time like this.

16:59.714 --> 17:02.874
If only I could fight like Reiji.

17:04.654 --> 17:05.584
Rin-Rin!

17:11.524 --> 17:12.284
Gholaoh.

17:15.294 --> 17:16.284
Gholaoh!

17:16.664 --> 17:18.164
That's right!

17:18.164 --> 17:20.694
I have Gholaoh with me!

17:27.604 --> 17:28.914
I'm such a fool!

17:28.914 --> 17:30.474
How could I be so weak?

17:30.474 --> 17:33.714
Since when did I start relying
on that good-for-nothing?

17:34.614 --> 17:37.744
If I didn't do everything I could now,
Rockaku would be right about me!

17:38.154 --> 17:41.814
I don't have to rely on others,
or do what they do!

17:42.054 --> 17:43.214
I am myself!

17:43.624 --> 17:48.324
I must think of a way for Gholaoh
and me to defeat all those dragons.

17:50.234 --> 17:51.354
There must be a way.

17:52.204 --> 17:53.094
Something!

17:59.104 --> 18:01.164
I know! That's what we can do!

18:03.744 --> 18:05.114
Listen, Gholaoh!

18:05.114 --> 18:07.344
Use every bit of strength you have now!

18:08.884 --> 18:11.254
Gholaoh isn't as strong as Chibi.

18:12.424 --> 18:16.114
And he can't fly the skies
like Kanper and Thundervolt.

18:17.524 --> 18:21.294
But Gholaoh and I can fight in our own way!

18:22.734 --> 18:24.494
Roar! Gholaoh!

18:45.084 --> 18:46.254
Rin-Rin!

18:46.254 --> 18:49.414
We did it! We got them all!

18:52.424 --> 18:53.624
In the end...

18:53.824 --> 18:56.854
...we couldn't defeat one girl, Maiko Yukino.

18:57.334 --> 18:58.794
It's all your fault, Darks.

18:59.604 --> 19:01.204
S-Sorry.

19:01.204 --> 19:05.604
There are only those timid-natured
Enlosiks in the desert.

19:06.074 --> 19:10.014
B-But I did what I could
by gathering five million of them!

19:10.174 --> 19:11.514
How many you got is irrelevant.

19:13.244 --> 19:15.874
But I was able to collect
battle data on Maiko Yukino...

19:16.454 --> 19:18.424
...so I'll forgive you this time.

19:20.924 --> 19:22.394
Let's go, Darks.

19:22.394 --> 19:23.114
Right!

19:23.454 --> 19:25.754
In the meantime, can you believe
how coldhearted those guys are?

19:26.564 --> 19:29.084
Ichirou Sumishiba and Hikaru Himuro.

19:29.564 --> 19:31.434
Those two really did go on without me.

19:32.834 --> 19:34.664
Well, I'd better be going.

19:35.274 --> 19:38.034
Actually, I have to get
to a city called Yaudim.

19:40.574 --> 19:43.144
But I'm glad I was able to drop by here.

19:43.144 --> 19:45.374
I believe I've found
my confidence again, thanks to you!

19:46.414 --> 19:48.544
I'll be sure to come again.

20:02.034 --> 20:05.524
Thank you for conveying my thoughts.

20:06.404 --> 20:07.974
You've done more than enough.

20:07.974 --> 20:09.464
You may go on.

20:11.174 --> 20:15.504
You can hear the thoughts left behind
by those who have passed away, can't you?

20:15.914 --> 20:17.104
I see.

20:17.514 --> 20:18.614
All right.

20:18.614 --> 20:20.344
Come with me, Rin-Rin!

20:20.714 --> 20:22.844
Maiko.

20:23.754 --> 20:27.584
This desert is harsh enough
to make a grown man cry.

20:27.584 --> 20:29.554
She's not gonna make it this far so easily.

20:29.554 --> 20:33.724
Maiko! Maiko! Maiko!

20:33.824 --> 20:35.664
Shut up!

20:35.664 --> 20:37.494
- Maiko's here!
- What?

20:39.434 --> 20:40.664
Well, well.

20:41.064 --> 20:42.904
Reiji!

20:42.904 --> 20:44.204
Rockaku!

20:45.174 --> 20:46.344
I think that now...

20:46.344 --> 20:50.074
...it would be fair to consider her
a skilled warrior.

20:55.854 --> 20:58.514
Hey, I thought you were
going ahead without me.

20:59.154 --> 21:01.394
How do you expect us to leave you behind?!

21:01.394 --> 21:03.254
That's easy to say.

21:03.254 --> 21:05.284
I'll bet you didn't even expect me
to get here, did you?

21:05.564 --> 21:07.854
Don't be so stubborn
and cause others to worry!

21:08.434 --> 21:09.894
We're friends, after all, aren't we?

21:10.594 --> 21:11.564
Reiji.

21:11.834 --> 21:14.704
Rockaku was worried
all this time as well, you know.

21:15.134 --> 21:19.304
He said he'd wait for you for only one hour,
yet he waited all this time 'til you got here.

21:19.704 --> 21:21.574
Y-You didn't hafta say that!

21:22.014 --> 21:23.504
Thank you. All of you.

21:23.874 --> 21:25.244
All right then, let's go!

21:28.984 --> 21:31.114
Hey, wanna hear what happened to me?!

21:31.114 --> 21:35.224
I defeated a bunch of dragons,
five million of them!

21:35.224 --> 21:36.094
That's a lie!

21:36.094 --> 21:37.824
There's a limit to what we'll believe.

21:37.824 --> 21:39.364
But it's true!

21:39.364 --> 21:40.164
Lies, all lies.

21:40.164 --> 21:42.994
It's not a lie! It's true!

21:56.744 --> 21:59.484
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.484 --> 22:02.254
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.254 --> 22:06.184
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.654 --> 22:10.424
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.424 --> 22:12.584
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.064 --> 22:17.154
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.604 --> 22:21.274
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.274 --> 22:24.004
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.004 --> 22:27.964
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.314 --> 22:31.814
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.814 --> 22:34.814
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.814 --> 22:39.684
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.354 --> 22:43.094
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.094 --> 22:45.864
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.864 --> 22:50.494
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.234 --> 22:54.004
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.004 --> 22:56.674
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.674 --> 23:01.304
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.974 --> 23:06.474
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.414 --> 23:13.084
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.594 --> 23:18.084
Next Episode

23:18.324 --> 23:19.624
We've finally arrived!

23:19.624 --> 23:21.684
Yaudim, where the tournament will be held!

23:22.564 --> 23:24.764
But everybody here seems really tough.

23:24.764 --> 23:25.924
Boy, they look scary!

23:26.804 --> 23:29.734
Our first opponent
is Unearned-Win King Magna!

23:29.734 --> 23:31.704
I don't like the sounds of that name.

23:33.504 --> 23:35.774
The previous champion,
Sun Wols, is also here?

23:35.774 --> 23:36.904
Where?! Where?! Where?!

23:37.574 --> 23:39.874
Next, on Dragon Drive, "The Gathering".

23:40.314 --> 23:42.314
There are also some
mysterious-looking guys here.

23:42.314 --> 23:43.914
The Gathering
They look really strong!

23:43.914 --> 23:45.114
The Gathering
